        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=A new HOT lead just came in.\n\nName: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Email }}\nCompany: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Company }}\nBudget: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Budget }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Message }}\n\nWhy it is hot: {{ $('Rate Lead').item.json.output.reason }}\n\nA draft reply is waiting in your Gmail drafts.",
